  "description": "Step 6 of an evidence-based GEO project — layered articles (deep analysis, evidence card, popular article, Q&A) and correction materials written from the project's claim library, one work record per article, medically reviewed, humanized with every number, quotation and drug name byte-identical, registered in the project.",
